.TH WEBTUIDB 1 "October 2026" "webtuidb" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
webtuidb \- a terminal TablePlus with an optional web front end
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B webtuidb
[\fIflags\fR] [\fIconnection-name\fR | \fIURL\fR]
.br
.B webtuidb \-\-frontend
[\-\-listen \fIaddr\fR] [\-\-open] [\-\-token \fItoken\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
webtuidb connects to PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB, ClickHouse, Cassandra, DynamoDB, Redis and MongoDB
(plus the Redshift, Greenplum, Vertica and SingleStore profiles), browses and edits data with pending changes,
runs queries, and is driven by tmux-style key bindings: the prefix key, then a key.
The same engine also serves a browser app with \fB\-\-frontend\fR.
.PP
With a \fIconnection-name\fR from connections.toml, or a URL such as
\fBpostgresql://user:pw@host/db?name=Prod\fR, webtuidb opens that connection directly.
Otherwise it shows the connection list.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-config \fIpath\fR
Path to config.toml (default: ~/.config/webtuidb/config.toml).
.TP
.B \-keys
Print the key bindings, after config overrides, and exit.
.TP
.B \-theme
Print the resolved theme as [theme.colors] TOML and exit.
.TP
.B \-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-frontend
Serve the web UI instead of starting the terminal UI.
.TP
.B \-listen \fIaddr\fR
With \-\-frontend: address to listen on (default 127.0.0.1:7788).
.TP
.B \-open
With \-\-frontend: open the browser.
.TP
.B \-token \fItoken\fR
With \-\-frontend: API token (default: random, printed once).
.TP
.B \-insecure\-listen
With \-\-frontend: allow a non-loopback \-\-listen address. Credentials then cross the network.
.TP
.B \-mcp
Serve the MCP tools over stdio and exit.
.TP
.B \-mcp\-config \fIclient\fR
Print the MCP server entry for claude-code, codex, cursor or vscode. The file it belongs in goes to stderr.
.TP
.B \-ssh\-log \fIpath\fR
Write an SSH tunnel debug log to \fIpath\fR.
.TP
.B \-completion \fIshell\fR
Print a completion script for bash, zsh or fish.
.TP
.B \-man
Print this manual page (roff).
.SH KEYS
Every prefixed action is: the prefix key, then the key. The default prefix is Ctrl+d; set it with
\fB[general] prefix\fR and rebind actions in \fB[keys]\fR. Press the prefix then \fB?\fR for the list for the pane
you are in, or run \fBwebtuidb \-keys\fR. Prefix twice sends a literal prefix key to the focused widget.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/webtuidb/config.toml
Settings: [general], [keys], [editor], [table], [sidebar], [queries], [export], [web], [theme].
.TP
.I ~/.config/webtuidb/connections.toml
Saved connections (mode 0600). Passwords are stored in plain text unless password_cmd is used.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/webtuidb/
Query history (history/*.jsonl), saved queries (queries/*.sql) and UI state (state.json).
.PP
XDG_CONFIG_HOME and XDG_DATA_HOME move these directories.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WEBTUIDB_OSC52
Set to 1 to copy over the terminal with OSC 52 even outside an SSH session. Inside SSH it is used automatically.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on any error (printed to stderr).
.SH SEE ALSO
README.md in the source tree for the full configuration reference.
